<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="FormRequest demo — Concept 2">
    <title>Contact · Concept 2</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Figtree:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/bootstrap-icons/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/contact.css">
</head>
<body class="contact-page">
    <nav class="promo-nav promo-nav-static">
        <div class="container-xxl d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
            <a class="brand" href="/">Concept <span>2</span></a>
            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                <a class="btn-promo btn-promo-ghost" href="/">Home</a>
                <a class="btn-promo btn-promo-ghost" href="/api/stats" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stats</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="contact-main">
        <div class="container-xxl">
            <p class="section-kicker">Step 10 · Casting</p>
            <h1 class="section-title">FormRequest → DTO demo</h1>
            <p class="section-lead">
                After validation, <code>toDto()</code> yields a <code>ContactDto</code>
                (typed fields). CSRF, flashes, errors, and old input come from ShareViewDataMiddleware.
            </p>

            {% if flashes.error is defined %}
                <div class="alert alert-danger border-0" role="alert">
                    {% for message in flashes.error %}
                        <div>{{ message }}</div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if success %}
                <div class="alert alert-success border-0" role="status">
                    <strong>OK.</strong> Data passed validation:
                    <code>{{ validated.name }}</code>,
                    <code>{{ validated.email }}</code>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <form class="contact-form" method="post" action="/contact" novalidate>
                <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token }}">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label" for="name">Name</label>
                    <input
                        type="text"
                        class="form-control{% if errors.name is defined %} is-invalid{% endif %}"
                        id="name"
                        name="name"
                        value="{{ old.name|default('') }}"
                        autocomplete="name"
                    >
                    {% if errors.name is defined %}
                        <div class="invalid-feedback d-block">
                            {% for message in errors.name %}
                                {{ message }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label" for="email">Email</label>
                    <input
                        type="email"
                        class="form-control{% if errors.email is defined %} is-invalid{% endif %}"
                        id="email"
                        name="email"
                        value="{{ old.email|default('') }}"
                        autocomplete="email"
                    >
                    {% if errors.email is defined %}
                        <div class="invalid-feedback d-block">
                            {% for message in errors.email %}
                                {{ message }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <label class="form-label" for="message">Message</label>
                    <textarea
                        class="form-control{% if errors.message is defined %} is-invalid{% endif %}"
                        id="message"
                        name="message"
                        rows="4"
                    >{{ old.message|default('') }}</textarea>
                    {% if errors.message is defined %}
                        <div class="invalid-feedback d-block">
                            {% for message in errors.message %}
                                {{ message }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-promo btn-promo-primary">Submit</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
